            },
            "description": "Administrator or Vorarbeiter only, never a plain Mitarbeiter. The reason is mandatory and audited. Use `schedule-<id>` in the path to reopen a Fixobjekt schedule instead of an Extra-Auftrag."
          }
        }
      ]
